@@ replace
Write cursors only for finished adapters, after step 5: `python3 -I -B ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/lib/config.py state-set <adapter> '<json>'`. The cursor shape is in each adapter file (Cursor). `state-set` replaces the whole value for that key, so merge maps (outreach `log_cursors` or `campaign_cursors`) with the old value first (`state-get <adapter>`).
@@ with
Write cursors only for finished adapters, after step 5: Read `state.json`, replace the value under `adapters.<adapter>`, and Write the file back (`${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/reference/config.md`, No Python, step 6). The cursor shape is in each adapter file (Cursor). The write replaces the whole value for that key, so merge maps (outreach `log_cursors` or `campaign_cursors`) with the old value first.
